   "source": [
    "# 02 — Artist Deep Dives\n",
    "One section per artist with consistent layout.\n",
    "\n",
    "Source/override note: The ETL reads YouTube channels from your `.env` (e.g., `YT_CHANNEL_*`) to ingest data.\n",
    "This notebook only filters and visualizes that data. The `ARTISTS` list below overrides which artists/channels\n",
    "to show here; leave it empty if you want to fill it interactively or derive from the DB. Use names as stored in\n",
    "songs.artist or youtube_videos.channel_title."
   ]
  },
  {
